c_n &=[U:C_n(\phi,U)]=[\phi^n(U):\phi^n(C_n(\phi,U))]=\\&=[\phi^n(U):C_n(\phi^{-1},U))=[U:C_n(\phi^{-1},U)]\cdot\Delta(\phi^n)=c_n^*\cdot \Delta(\phi^n).
